# Environment Variables for College Football Analysis Project

# College Football Data API Key
# Get your API key from: https://collegefootballdata.com/
# Sign up for a free account and generate an API key
CFBD_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored)
# 2. Replace 'your_api_key_here' with your actual API key
# 3. Never commit .env to version control
